Privacy Policy — SkyLight Complications
Last updated: April 20, 2026
Data Collection
SkyLight Complications does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data to external servers.
Location Data
The app requests access to device GPS location solely to calculate sunrise and sunset times. Location data is stored locally on the device only and is never shared with third parties.
In-App Purchases
Purchase transactions are handled entirely by Google Play. We do not process or store payment information.
Third-Party Services
The app uses Google Play Billing. Google's privacy policy applies to purchase transactions: https://policies.google.com/privacy
